	(text "If VUSB=5V then EN pin wil be around 1,6V and regulator will turn on even if Arduino keeps AO/A2 low.\nSo the LEXI, when connected to a PC, can be turned ON (e.g for debug purposes) just by pressing ON pushbutton (SW1) \nwithout any interaction with Arduino software"
